<title>POLAND: PLI SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>PLI SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> SEPTEMBER		1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.29 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.53 vs   0.05</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.36 vs   0.02 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    3.45 vs   0.77</p>
<p> JANUARY-SEPTEMBER    1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.94 vs   0.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.09 vs   0.39</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.14 vs   0.65 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   28.14 vs  11.55</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish wholesaler is Polish Life</p>
<p>Improvement SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
